{
  "id": "nordic_nrf54",
  "name": "Nordic nRF54L/nRF5340 BLE SoC 通用协议",
  "vendor": {
    "vendorName": "Nordic Semiconductor",
    "chipSeries": "nRF54L15 / nRF54L10 / nRF54H20 / nRF5340",
    "protocolVersion": "v1.0",
    "website": "https://www.nordicsemi.com",
    "description": "Nordic nRF54 系列 BLE SoC 是业界标杆低功耗蓝牙芯片。nRF54L15 采用先进工艺，支持BLE 5.4+、LE Audio、信道探测(Channel Sounding)、2Mbps PHY。nRF5340 为双核设计(应用核 Cortex-M33 @128MHz + 网络核 Cortex-M33 @64MHz)。OTA采用 MCUboot 开源引导加载器 + SMP(Simple Management Protocol) over BLE。SMP Service UUID: 8D53DC1D-1DB7-4CD3-868B-8A527460AA84。广泛用于智能眼镜、健康监测、IoT设备。nRF Connect SDK 基于 Zephyr RTOS。"
  },
